        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 220304, 4 Inch Recessed Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 4 Inch Rectangular Flush Pull features a low profile that makes it a good choice for use on sliding pocket doors. It is mortised into the face of the door for a clean look once installed. The 4 Inch Recessed Pull is available in a wide array of finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek 220304 Pocket Door Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish brad nails.</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
